# ============================================================
# hl2sb-gamefile — 只收录可编辑的文本资源
# 二进制资源(材质/模型/地图/贴图/音频/字体)一律排除
# ============================================================

# --- 二进制资源:贴图 / 材质二进制 ---
*.vtf
*.vtx
*.vvd
*.phy
*.vvc
*.mdl
*.ani
*.ain
*.bsp
*.nav
*.wav
*.mp3
*.ogg
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tga
*.psd
*.ttf
*.otf
*.vfont
*.pyh

# --- 二进制数据/缓存 ---
*.cache
*.dt
*.dat
*.lst
*.bin
*.pak
*.vpk
*.vpcf_c
*.sav
*.dem
*.tmp
*.pid
*.mdmp
*.dmp

# --- 编译产物 / 库 ---
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.obj
*.o
*.so
*.dylib
*.exe

# --- 日志与备份 ---
*.log
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.prev.log
*.old
lua_backup_*/

# --- 运行期生成目录 ---
dumps/
shots/
bin/
download/
downloadlists/
last_launcher.pid

# --- 编辑器缓存 / IDE 工程文件 ---
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.vsidx
*.wsuo
*.suo
*.user
*.sqlite
*.lock
*.sln
*.vcxproj*
*.filters

# --- 含大量二进制的资源目录(保留其中文本由上层规则决定) ---
# materials/ 与 models/ 下的 .vmt/.vdf 仍会被收录(vmt 是文本)

# --- 本地开发说明(不纳入版本控制) ---
AGENT.md

# --- 运行期生成的硬件/视频配置(热生产文件) ---
videoconfig*.cfg
